{{toneGuidance}}
{{#kr}}
{{koreanRegisterGuidance}}
{{/kr}}
{{#populateFormalityNote}}
Populate `formalityNote` (in {{metaLang}}) only when the listener-speaker relationship would materially change the {{#isPolish}}rewrite{{/isPolish}}{{^isPolish}}translation{{/isPolish}} (e.g., to a boss vs. to a friend). Otherwise empty string.
